			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove pub use re-exports from module public interfaces\n\nRemove wildcard and specific public re-exports from ApplicationState internal modules and the Air module. These re-exports were providing convenience access to internal types but violated encapsulation principles:\n\n- Air: Remove re-exports of AirClient, AirMetrics, AirStatus, and related types\n- ExtensionScanner: Remove ScanAndPopulateExtensions re-export\n- PathResolution: Remove ResolveMementoStorageFilePath re-export\n- Persistence: Remove MementoLoader and MementoSaver re-exports\n- Recovery: Remove RecoverState re-export\n- Serialization: Remove URLSerializer and URLDeserializer re-exports\n\nTypes should now be accessed via their explicit module paths rather than through re-exported shortcuts. This improves code clarity, prevents implicit dependencies, and enforces proper module boundaries.",
			"SHA": "8f12359311b56898cb7ee85280a905527c751ea4"
		},
