				159
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Standardize dev_log! macro formatting across codebase\n\nReformat all dev_log! macro invocations from single-line to multi-line format for improved readability. This affects ~150+ call sites across Air, ApplicationState, Binary, Environment, IPC, RPC, RunTime, Telemetry, and Vine modules.\n\nAdditional improvements:\n- Add .js.map 204 handling in vscode-file scheme handler (DevTools compatibility)\n- Improve extension scanner logging for first-run scenarios (non-existent directory is debug-level, not warn)\n- Add NLS placeholder resolution logging to extension scanner\n\nNo functional changes aside from the DevTools .js.map fix and improved logging levels for first-run extension directories.",
			"SHA": "f0449be512c142adb02fd0397b03a2f4c5f79623"
		},
